cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the research draft in preferred-citation and identify the
  repository commit or release used.
title: "Degree-3 spectral refinement verification package"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Swihart"
    given-names: "Bruce J."
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research package for an AI-assisted candidate degree-3 spectral
  refinement of Nishioka's lower bound for the three-dimensional
  Blaschke-Lebesgue problem. The package contains a LaTeX manuscript, proof
  notes, exact symbolic Python checks, independent R tests, and automated build
  and preflight workflows.
keywords:
  - "bodies of constant width"
  - "Blaschke-Lebesgue problem"
  - "spherical harmonics"
  - "convex geometry"
  - "reproducible research"
preferred-citation:
  type: unpublished
  title: >-
    A Degree-Three Spectral Refinement of Nishioka's Lower Bound for the
    Three-Dimensional Blaschke-Lebesgue Problem
  authors:
    - family-names: "Swihart"
      given-names: "Bruce J."
  year: 2026
  license: CC-BY-4.0
  notes: >-
    AI-assisted, non-peer-reviewed research draft seeking independent
    mathematical verification.
